{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792571627150,"sessionID":"ses_ea2691a44ffemHBxOiocBq67ci","part":{"partID":"prt_15d985661001TvfoGXp8GDIHfV","sessionID":"ses_ea2691a44ffemHBxOiocBq67ci","messageID":"msg_15d982183001QwlNw7D5R5FXeg","type":"tool","id":"call_00_n1j0lkf8xc8uxk199gq74bx5","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-auxiliary-pilot-2026-10-21/home-care/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/AUTHOR_INPUT.json","offset":143,"limit":1},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-auxiliary-pilot-2026-10-21/home-care/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/AUTHOR_INPUT.json, lines 143-143\n143:  \"arch\": \"# Home Care Ledger: target architecture\\n\\n## Scope and decisions to confirm\\n- Local single-user target: one homeowner, one home, loopback only.\\n- Python 3.11+ standard library only; SQLite; no third-party packages.\\n- This is a cognition template, not an application and not the upstream micasa codebase.\\n- Deliberately excluded: accounts and authentication, notifications, email, vendors, costs, quotes, projects, documents, manuals, photos, payments, LLM, multi-property, imports and exports, and deletion endpoints.\\n- Decision: exactly one home with fixed id `home`, because the pinned scenario is the user's own home and upstream exposes a single house profile.\\n- Decision: recurrence is every N calendar days, 1..3650, because the scenario says every N days. Upstream uses interval months; this target is not API-compatible with it.\\n- Decision: a plan created without an anchor is due on the server local creation date.\\n- Decision: a backdated completion never moves next due backwards; next due is based on the latest completion date.\\n- Decision: no natural-language dates and no timezone-bearing timestamps in domain dates.\\n\\n## Runtime, data directory, start\\n- Source file `app.py`; database `$HOMECARE_DATA_DIR/homecare.sqlite3`.\\n- `HOMECARE_DATA_DIR` defaults to `./data`; the directory is created if absent.\\n- Start: `python3 app.py --data-dir ./data --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8765`.\\n- Equivalent environment variables: `HOMECARE_DATA_DIR`, `HOMECARE_HOST`, `HOMECARE_PORT`.\\n- Bind loopback by default. There is no authentication; do not expose the port.\\n- On first start create schema and indexes. Schema version 1 is created once; no migration beyond that.\\n- SQLite connection setup: `PRAGMA foreign_keys=ON`, `journal_mode=WAL`, `busy_timeout=5000`.\\n- Server: `ThreadingHTTPServer` is acceptable, but every write uses one explicit SQLite transaction.\\n- JSON is UTF-8. Maximum request body 1,048,576 bytes. POST and PATCH must send `application/json`; otherwis... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 144]","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":true},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-auxiliary-pilot-2026-10-21/home-care/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/AUTHOR_INPUT.json, lines 143-143\n143:  \"arch\": \"# Home Care Ledger: target architecture\\n\\n## Scope and decisions to confirm\\n- Local single-user target: one homeowner, one home, loopback only.\\n- Python 3.11+ standard library only; SQLite; no third-party packages.\\n- This is a cognition template, not an application and not the upstream micasa codebase.\\n- Deliberately excluded: accounts and authentication, notifications, email, vendors, costs, quotes, projects, documents, manuals, photos, payments, LLM, multi-property, imports and exports, and deletion endpoints.\\n- Decision: exactly one home with fixed id `home`, because the pinned scenario is the user's own home and upstream exposes a single house profile.\\n- Decision: recurrence is every N calendar days, 1..3650, because the scenario says every N days. Upstream uses interval months; this target is not API-compatible with it.\\n- Decision: a plan created without an anchor is due on the server local creation date.\\n- Decision: a backdated completion never moves next due backwards; next due is based on the latest completion date.\\n- Decision: no natural-language dates and no timezone-bearing timestamps in domain dates.\\n\\n## Runtime, data directory, start\\n- Source file `app.py`; database `$HOMECARE_DATA_DIR/homecare.sqlite3`.\\n- `HOMECARE_DATA_DIR` defaults to `./data`; the directory is created if absent.\\n- Start: `python3 app.py --data-dir ./data --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8765`.\\n- Equivalent environment variables: `HOMECARE_DATA_DIR`, `HOMECARE_HOST`, `HOMECARE_PORT`.\\n- Bind loopback by default. There is no authentication; do not expose the port.\\n- On first start create schema and indexes. Schema version 1 is created once; no migration beyond that.\\n- SQLite connection setup: `PRAGMA foreign_keys=ON`, `journal_mode=WAL`, `busy_timeout=5000`.\\n- Server: `ThreadingHTTPServer` is acceptable, but every write uses one explicit SQLite transaction.\\n- JSON is UTF-8. Maximum request body 1,048,576 bytes. POST and PATCH must send `application/json`; otherwis... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 144]"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/docs/template-factory/go-auxiliary-pilot-2026-10-21/home-care/calls/blueprint-spec-review-aux/source/candidate/AUTHOR_INPUT.json\", \"offset\": 143, \"limit\": 1}"},"time":{"start":1792571627105,"end":1792571627150}}}}
